{
  "job_B23.3.1.5_20251003_114604": {
    "chunk_text": "Se\u00f0e on anre nihte monan weor\u00f0e\u00f0 untrum, se bi\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6re adle swi\u00f0e geswenced. On II nihta monan, hra\u00f0e \u00e6fter sare he arise\u00f0. Gif on III he winne\u00f0, & eft in \u00fe\u00e6re untrumnesse se mon swelte\u00f0. Gif on IIII, he winne\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0. Gif on V, ne gedege\u00f0 \u00fee \u00fea adle. Gif on VI, he winne\u00f0 & arise\u00f0. On VII nihte aldne monnan, he sceal feala findan, butan him mihtig God milde wur\u00fee, f\u00e6rlice hine dea\u00f0 Gif he bi\u00f0 an VIII, ne leofe\u00f0 he na lange. Gif on IX, he bi\u00f0 lange seoc. Gif on X, on his heortan unh\u00e6lo cym\u00f0, & he bi\u00f0 fr\u00e6cno\u00f0. Gif on XI, on langum sare he sarga\u00f0, & he gelomlice his h\u00e6lo hafo\u00f0 eft. Gif on XII, he winne\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0. On XIII, lytel sticce he lige\u00f0 seoc. On XIIII, he winne\u00f0 & arise\u00f0. Gif on XV, fr\u00e6clice bi\u00f0 his \u00feing. Gif on XVI, on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe he arise\u00f0. Gif on XVII, he swince\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0. On XVIII, he winne\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0. On XIX, he winne\u00f0 & arise\u00f0. On XX, he arise\u00f0. On XXI, he bi\u00f0 lange seoc. On XXII, r\u00e6dlice he hal arise\u00f0. On XXIII, he arise\u00f0. On XXIIII, he bi\u00f0 langa lama & swelte\u00f0. On XXV, he hra\u00fee arise\u00f0. Gif on XXVI & on XXVII, frecne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mannes \u00feing, \u00fe\u00e6t ifel unea\u00f0e befli\u00f0. On XXVIII & on XXIX, he of \u00feam sare sone arise\u00f0. Gif XXX",
